<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Nov 7.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - Nov 7.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name			Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Villa World	    10.58     1.04</p>
<p> 2   Prime Credit Tr	10.32     0.95</p>
<p> 3   Prop Income Inv	 9.86     1.03</p>
<p> 4   BT Prop Trust	   9.66     1.69</p>
<p> 5   Indu Property	   9.29     0.98</p>
<p> 6   Colonial Mutual	 9.20     1.13</p>
<p> 7   Aust Tour		 8.93     0.84</p>
<p> 8   Centro Prop	     8.86     2.20</p>
<p> 9   Armstrong Retail	8.57     0.77</p>
<p>10   McIntosh Sec	    8.49     1.06</p>
<p>11   Gandel Retail Tr	8.48     0.92</p>
<p>12   Equitilink		8.47     0.59</p>
<p>13   MT Leyshon Gold	 8.39     2.98</p>
<p>14   Gen Prop Tr	     8.31     2.42</p>
<p>15   Advance Pro CB	  8.29     1.40</p>
<p>16   Barclays Mirvac	 8.27     1.33</p>
